              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekuhambeni njalo, ezingozini zamanzi, ezingozini zabaphangi, ezingozini ngabakithi, ezingozini ngabezizwe, engozini emzini, engozini enkangala, engozini olwandle, engozini phakathi kwabazalwane bamanga.",
